The fork is based on LeRobot 0.6.2.

Modifications made by Juxi Technology, as required by
Apache License 2.0, section 4(b):

  1. SO-ARM101 motor configuration changed from 6 servos to 7.

     src/lerobot/robots/so_follower/so_follower.py
     src/lerobot/teleoperators/so_leader/so_leader.py

       - a new wrist_yaw servo is added as ID 5
       - the original wrist_roll motor moves to ID 6 (name unchanged)
       - the gripper moves from ID 6 to ID 7
       - the gripper keeps RANGE_0_100; all other joints use DEGREES

  2. Calibration changed so no joint is treated as a full-turn joint.

     Same two files, in calibrate():

       The upstream code hard-codes wrist_roll as a full-turn joint
       (0-4095). After the 7-DOF modification the wrist yaw and roll
       joints have mechanical limits, so calibration now records the
       real range of motion of every joint with
       record_ranges_of_motion().

  3. README.md rewritten, and README_CN.md added.

Everything else is unmodified upstream code, and all upstream
copyright, license and attribution notices are retained.
